<title>INDIA: India 97/98 crude output seen at 34.37 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 97/98 crude output seen at 34.37 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian goverment said on Friday that crude oil production in 1997/98 (April-March) was targeted at 34.37 million tonnes compared with an estimated 33.72 million tonnes in 1996/97.</p>
</text>
